(6768851, 1015177, 23412, '<td valign="top">This shot is well focused and I like the composition, but your model let you down.  There are several butterflies and/or moths in this challenge and yours is just not as colorful as some.  Also that frond he is resting on appears to be decaying on the end, and I think that goes against the lively greens of the majority of the background.</td>', 'This shot is well focused and I like the composition, but your model let you down.  There are several butterflies and/or moths in this challenge and yours is just not as colorful as some.  Also that frond he is resting on appears to be decaying on the end, and I think that goes against the lively greens of the majority of the background.', '2012-05-14 13:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
