(6773115, 1015253, 98339, '<td valign="top">The sizing of your photo (IMO) seems to this really hurt what the viewers can see, you''ve lost alot of the detail of your beautiful flower.</td>', 'The sizing of your photo (IMO) seems to this really hurt what the viewers can see, you''ve lost alot of the detail of your beautiful flower.', '2012-05-19 11:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
