(6773118, 1015336, 98339, '<td valign="top">You need to go back to this pond for Ansel Adams</td>', 'You need to go back to this pond for Ansel Adams', '2012-05-19 12:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773149, 1015268, 100831, '<td valign="top">I see Me</td>', 'I see Me', '2012-05-19 12:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773249, 1014422, 39057, '<td valign="top">Then like in poetry I go dot-dot-dot, you know, kinda off center, then I drop down and then I go: "Leavin'' his soul! And partin'' the waters of the medulla oblongata of - -brrrrrr! - -mankind!" That was a damn good song, wasn''t it Doyle?</td>', 'Then like in poetry I go dot-dot-dot, you know, kinda off center, then I drop down and then I go: "Leavin'' his soul! And partin'' the waters of the medulla oblongata of - -brrrrrr! - -mankind!" That was a damn good song, wasn''t it Doyle?', '2012-05-19 17:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773338, 1015340, 109363, '<td valign="top">o, would have been a nice one for Ansel Adams</td>', 'o, would have been a nice one for Ansel Adams', '2012-05-19 22:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773345, 1015366, 138630, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and detail - I love the placement of the gull in the frame.  A top scorer for me.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and detail - I love the placement of the gull in the frame.  A top scorer for me.', '2012-05-19 22:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773346, 1014291, 138630, '<td valign="top">The symmetry, detail, colors and exposure all look perfect to me.  Well titled - one of my top scores.</td>', 'The symmetry, detail, colors and exposure all look perfect to me.  Well titled - one of my top scores.', '2012-05-19 22:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773347, 1015089, 138630, '<td valign="top">Terrific perspective that adds a great deal of interest to this (almost) perfectly symmetrical image - couldn''t you get him to lift his left leg just a bit?</td>', 'Terrific perspective that adds a great deal of interest to this (almost) perfectly symmetrical image - couldn''t you get him to lift his left leg just a bit?', '2012-05-19 22:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773348, 1015343, 138630, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and detail on this plumeria blossom.  You can hardly beat pink and green for an eye-catching color combo.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and detail on this plumeria blossom.  You can hardly beat pink and green for an eye-catching color combo.', '2012-05-19 22:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773349, 1015308, 138630, '<td valign="top">In-camera blur, I think - I love the way this spirals in to that one perfectly sharp heart.  A beautiful image and one of my top scorers.</td>', 'In-camera blur, I think - I love the way this spirals in to that one perfectly sharp heart.  A beautiful image and one of my top scorers.', '2012-05-19 22:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773350, 1015297, 138630, '<td valign="top">The symmetry is excellent, I like the overall composition, and the metallic tones are very appealing.  One of my favorite entries in the challenge.</td>', 'The symmetry is excellent, I like the overall composition, and the metallic tones are very appealing.  One of my favorite entries in the challenge.', '2012-05-19 22:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773351, 1015274, 138630, '<td valign="top">A fun and funny perspective adds interest to this one.  Nice depth of field.</td>', 'A fun and funny perspective adds interest to this one.  Nice depth of field.', '2012-05-19 22:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773352, 1015280, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nature''s symmetry is never quite perfect, I think - which is not a fault at all.  I like the lines and tones here a lot.</td>', 'Nature''s symmetry is never quite perfect, I think - which is not a fault at all.  I like the lines and tones here a lot.', '2012-05-19 22:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773353, 1015340, 138630, '<td valign="top">This really pops against the dark background.  Very nice tones.</td>', 'This really pops against the dark background.  Very nice tones.', '2012-05-19 22:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773354, 1014804, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like that the overall image is, as the title says, almost symmetrical.  Also like that I can see the 2nd eye on these cute fellows - that reminds me that they are each symmetrical, too.  Nice focus.</td>', 'I like that the overall image is, as the title says, almost symmetrical.  Also like that I can see the 2nd eye on these cute fellows - that reminds me that they are each symmetrical, too.  Nice focus.', '2012-05-19 22:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773355, 1015234, 138630, '<td valign="top">Lovely shadow and light play and so very nice in black and white.</td>', 'Lovely shadow and light play and so very nice in black and white.', '2012-05-19 22:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773356, 1015181, 138630, '<td valign="top">The orchid itself is beautifully crisp.  I would have liked less definition in the background - find it slightly distracting.  It''s still an excellent entry in my opinion.</td>', 'The orchid itself is beautifully crisp.  I would have liked less definition in the background - find it slightly distracting.  It''s still an excellent entry in my opinion.', '2012-05-19 23:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773357, 1015352, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail and the centered composition works well here.  Great color combination, too.</td>', 'Very nice detail and the centered composition works well here.  Great color combination, too.', '2012-05-19 23:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773358, 1015091, 138630, '<td valign="top">The perfect perspective for showing off this proud fellow''s symmetry - amazing that it even extends to the placement of the "eyes" on either side.  Great neon colors, too.</td>', 'The perfect perspective for showing off this proud fellow''s symmetry - amazing that it even extends to the placement of the "eyes" on either side.  Great neon colors, too.', '2012-05-19 23:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773359, 1015373, 138630, '<td valign="top">The two tones are quite eye-catching.</td>', 'The two tones are quite eye-catching.', '2012-05-19 23:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773374, 1015196, 109363, '<td valign="top">a great entry for the Ansel Adams challenge!</td>', 'a great entry for the Ansel Adams challenge!', '2012-05-19 23:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773380, 1015377, 138174, '<td valign="top">awesome!!</td>', 'awesome!!', '2012-05-20 00:15:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6773524, 1015223, 109227, '<td valign="top">My top pick; very artsy image and well done.  (voted earlier)</td>', 'My top pick; very artsy image and well done.  (voted earlier)', '2012-05-20 10:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773525, 1015306, 109227, '<td valign="top">Like the fine art feel of this one. Nicely done. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Like the fine art feel of this one. Nicely done. (voted earlier)', '2012-05-20 10:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773526, 1014863, 109227, '<td valign="top">One of my favs of the challenge. Hope it does well for you. (voted earlier)</td>', 'One of my favs of the challenge. Hope it does well for you. (voted earlier)', '2012-05-20 10:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773527, 1015308, 109227, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Beautiful abstract. (voted earlier)', '2012-05-20 10:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773529, 1015280, 109227, '<td valign="top">Well done; nice use of shadow and light. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Well done; nice use of shadow and light. (voted earlier)', '2012-05-20 10:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773532, 1015366, 109227, '<td valign="top">The shifts in light at the top really add to this.  Nice job. (voted earlier)</td>', 'The shifts in light at the top really add to this.  Nice job. (voted earlier)', '2012-05-20 10:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773533, 1015330, 109227, '<td valign="top">I really like this image and concept; the starfish would be a tad sharper. (voted earlier)</td>', 'I really like this image and concept; the starfish would be a tad sharper. (voted earlier)', '2012-05-20 10:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773534, 1015159, 109227, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones and colors. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Beautiful tones and colors. (voted earlier)', '2012-05-20 10:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773535, 1015335, 109227, '<td valign="top">Great find. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Great find. (voted earlier)', '2012-05-20 10:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773566, 1015048, 63218, '<td valign="top">Instant fav! You took full advantage of the natural visual elements of this pretty Iris &amp; made a really nice abstract that would look good hanging on the wall. Looks like natural light, or at least slightly directional light. WTG!</td>', 'Instant fav! You took full advantage of the natural visual elements of this pretty Iris & made a really nice abstract that would look good hanging on the wall. Looks like natural light, or at least slightly directional light. WTG!', '2012-05-20 12:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773568, 1015272, 63218, '<td valign="top">Instant fav! My favorite orchid , &amp; you''ve made a lovely asymmetrical comp without loosing the wonderful orchid symmetrical balance. Beautiful light, also. WTG!</td>', 'Instant fav! My favorite orchid , & you''ve made a lovely asymmetrical comp without loosing the wonderful orchid symmetrical balance. Beautiful light, also. WTG!', '2012-05-20 12:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773571, 1015355, 63218, '<td valign="top">The bud in front is a nice touch, the way you lined it up. I like the soft easy light &amp; the flat, graphic look of this. Makes me wonder what lens, what settings, etc. And the water drops. Easy fav.</td>', 'The bud in front is a nice touch, the way you lined it up. I like the soft easy light & the flat, graphic look of this. Makes me wonder what lens, what settings, etc. And the water drops. Easy fav.', '2012-05-20 12:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773572, 1014291, 63218, '<td valign="top">Oh very nice. Clean lovely light &amp; almost perfect DOF. Well done.</td>', 'Oh very nice. Clean lovely light & almost perfect DOF. Well done.', '2012-05-20 12:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773575, 1015387, 63218, '<td valign="top">Great emotional impact in the petals created by the saturated red, no loss of symmetry in that dancing circle. This must''ve been quite a sight to see. Fav, just because I want to look at it again &amp; again.</td>', 'Great emotional impact in the petals created by the saturated red, no loss of symmetry in that dancing circle. This must''ve been quite a sight to see. Fav, just because I want to look at it again & again.', '2012-05-20 12:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773576, 1014932, 63218, '<td valign="top">Wow, that looks like a wild party in there! Well done! I''ll bet this poppy offered more than one interesting crop.</td>', 'Wow, that looks like a wild party in there! Well done! I''ll bet this poppy offered more than one interesting crop.', '2012-05-20 12:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773577, 1015352, 63218, '<td valign="top">It seems to float. I think it wants me to take it to my leader! And that red is also gorgeous!</td>', 'It seems to float. I think it wants me to take it to my leader! And that red is also gorgeous!', '2012-05-20 12:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773578, 1015308, 63218, '<td valign="top">Lots of energy in this. Well done. Can''t figure out how you did this, &amp; I love it.</td>', 'Lots of energy in this. Well done. Can''t figure out how you did this, & I love it.', '2012-05-20 12:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773692, 1014804, 109227, '<td valign="top">Great macro. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Great macro. (voted earlier)', '2012-05-20 17:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773693, 1015031, 109227, '<td valign="top">I like the "high key" look of this image. (voted earlier)</td>', 'I like the "high key" look of this image. (voted earlier)', '2012-05-20 17:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773694, 1014291, 109227, '<td valign="top">Best of the orchid images, imo.  nicely done. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Best of the orchid images, imo.  nicely done. (voted earlier)', '2012-05-20 17:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773695, 1015351, 109227, '<td valign="top">Nice use of light and shadow. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Nice use of light and shadow. (voted earlier)', '2012-05-20 17:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
