(6796595, 1015305, 138630, '<td valign="top">You said you would like comments on entries, not necessarily this one but on entries, so I came over to see what you have that I voted on.  Gave this one a 6.  I thought it fit the challenge very well and was nicely focused.  Head on is tough but you pulled it off and again it works particularly well for "symmetry".  I think this one could have scored quite a bit better with a few post-processing tweaks.  I would have liked to see blacker blacks (especially) and whiter whites in the zebra - maybe a little dodge and burn (esp).  The image feels crooked.  I would rotate clockwise.  You might also try this in black and white - zebra images work particularly well that way and the green wouldn''t overpower the subject if you did.  Just some ideas I would try - I think you have a very nice photo here.</td>', 'You said you would like comments on entries, not necessarily this one but on entries, so I came over to see what you have that I voted on.  Gave this one a 6.  I thought it fit the challenge very well and was nicely focused.  Head on is tough but you pulled it off and again it works particularly well for "symmetry".  I think this one could have scored quite a bit better with a few post-processing tweaks.  I would have liked to see blacker blacks (especially) and whiter whites in the zebra - maybe a little dodge and burn (esp).  The image feels crooked.  I would rotate clockwise.  You might also try this in black and white - zebra images work particularly well that way and the green wouldn''t overpower the subject if you did.  Just some ideas I would try - I think you have a very nice photo here.', '2012-06-16 10:23:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6841092, 1015176, 48228, '<td valign="top">WOW NICE ONE MATE... LOVE THE FOCUS AND YES IT DID SO WELL FOR YU FROM SHEZ<br/></td>', 'WOW NICE ONE MATE... LOVE THE FOCUS AND YES IT DID SO WELL FOR YU FROM SHEZ', '2012-08-14 05:38:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6858166, 1015239, 67152, '<td valign="top">Wonderful richness of the conversion and excellent use of negative space to create an image with impact.  The shape of the bird is magical and perfectly meets the challenge.  However, what makes the image engaging likely cost you substantially in the score - the uncentered positioning of the bird.  <br/> <br/>You have a wonderful image here, and I can understand why it is your DPC profile image.</td>', 'Wonderful richness of the conversion and excellent use of negative space to create an image with impact.  The shape of the bird is magical and perfectly meets the challenge.  However, what makes the image engaging likely cost you substantially in the score - the uncentered positioning of the bird.   You have a wonderful image here, and I can understand why it is your DPC profile image.', '2012-09-06 13:29:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6985262, 1015223, 103142, '<td valign="top">This still has to be one of the most awesome shots on DPC!! This is the gold standard of art shots, imo.</td>', 'This still has to be one of the most awesome shots on DPC!! This is the gold standard of art shots, imo.', '2013-02-24 14:30:32.000000', NULL, 0),
